I had something I wanted to say in the driveway, and I dropped it because you’d had a double.” That’s smaller than the sentence, but it tells him the silence isn’t emptiness.\n\nDoes that feel possible, or does even that feel like too much right now?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"Exactly — he can’t read the intention behind the silence. From your side it’s “I’m protecting you”; from his side it’s just blank space where words should be.\n\nYou don’t necessarily have to hand him the whole sentence to change that. You could hand him the fact that it exists: “I had something I wanted to say in the driveway, and I dropped it because you’d had a double.” That’s smaller than the sentence, but it tells him the silence isn’t emptiness.\n\nDoes that feel possible, or does even that feel like too much right now?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":4241,"promptTokens":705,"completionTokens":539,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:07"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":19,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"dcbc66fa9376441ab3ae9d38e9a08dc0","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0013249953495167769,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b04f367beecf50d3847f7c7","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486567060,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:07","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f367beecf50d3847f7c7","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"no. how would he. from his side it probably just looks like i dont have anything to say to him","options":null,"imag